    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional Driving Mechanics</strong>: Mechanics put together by someone who has at least read about cars, and knows they are large and go fast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Insane Tracks</strong>: From loop-de-loops to dodging tipped RVs, every course is a test of how well you can handle your ride and anticipate the insane race organizer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue NPC Competitors</strong>: Your rivals race as if they're all trying to make it home from the bar before their wives wake up. Cars will be dented, walls will be scraped, there's a respawn mechanic for a reason.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Series of Ridiculous Cars</strong>: Collect a motley series of vehicles to race with, ranging from &quot;Cars I wanted as a middle-schooler&quot; to &quot;The worst possible racer I can conceive of.&quot; </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So buckle up (seriously, safety first) and get ready to race like you\u2019ve never raced before.</p>",
